  "description": "Bae Seong-Yun is a middle-aged man who fell in love with gambling, even gambling his own body. He loses a game to gambler Yu I-Yeon, who hates gambling addicts due to the trauma caused by his father. \n\n“Bae Seong-Yun, if you bite your tongue, I'll kill you.” \n\nI-Yeon brings Bae Seong-Yun home after impulsively playing a game with him and winning, and he makes Seong-Yun realize the meaning of his body being sold...\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
